  "qualification": {
    "memory_evidence": "MEASURED on this Mac, 2026-09-26 [M], twice: the standalone qualification run (704x448, 97 frames, 24 fps, seed 42, 298.5 s wall, 4.04 s of output with audio, peak process footprint 16.38 GB, peak MLX Metal 13.19 GB) and the same configuration through the Video worker's own job path (304.0 s wall, peak MLX 14,163,847,570 bytes, peak ri_phys footprint 15.71 GB sampled at 1 Hz, artifact 1,784,058 bytes with one video and one audio track). MEASURED a third time at the true-16:9 canvas [M]: 1024x576, 49 frames, 24 fps, seed 42, 351.6 s wall, 2.04 s of output, 9.36 GB peak MLX Metal, 1,403,485 bytes (qualification/ltx-video-results-16x9-20260927/). The measurement is the reason the tier is 24 GB rather than the vendor's 16 GB: MLX had no memory pressure to trim on a 32 GB host, so 16.38 GB is a floor, not a worst case. 16 GB is not offered the model. MEASURED a fourth time at that same canvas through the Video worker's own job path [M]: job e9caa8c4ce2a4074a29d2349a99193ce, 1024x576, 49 frames, 24 fps with audio, 258.0 s wall, peak process footprint 16.92 GB (16,919,438,528 bytes, sampled ri_phys_footprint at 1 Hz), peak MLX 10,046,030,772 bytes, artifact 2,055,736 bytes with one video and one audio track (qualification/ltx-video-worker-results-20260928-004554/). That footprint is the number that decides the tier: 16.9 GB at the canvas the owner accepts, so a 16 GB Mac cannot hold it even though the MLX allocator reports only 10.05 GB of it.",
    "minimum_unified_memory_gb": 24,
    "reason": "Qualified by runs of two published configurations on the owner's 32 GB M2 Max through the pack's own mixed-precision loader: 704x448x97f twice (298.5 s standalone, 304.0 s through the worker's job path) and 1024x576x49f once (351.6 s, the true-16:9 canvas). What is NOT covered and is not claimed: no run on a 24 GB machine, and text-to-video has not been run on hardware here. The lane publishes a measured runtime for the configurations that were run, and the longest duration of any canvas that was not run at that duration is not claimed.",
    "recommended_unified_memory_gb": 32,
    "status": "qualified"
  },
